+--!strict
+-- The Grashanveil dress (zone armour, the Grashanveil set): a Grashan
+-- sun-priestess's ceremonial gown. A pale ruin-stone bodice, fitted with gold
+-- seams and a terracotta stomacher carrying a gold sun-eye; a terracotta sash
+-- and green ribbon cinch the waist over a knotted bow. The upper sleeves are
+-- slim pale stone with only a thin terracotta cuff, so the shoulder line stays
+-- quiet, and the skirt hangs in wide panels set to the outside of each thigh,
+-- meeting at the centre into one full skirt that flares to a broad hem.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local stone = { 170, 164, 150 } -- pale ruin stone
+local stoneShade = { 140, 134, 122 } -- folds and shadowed layers
